}c_{lj_{2}}\beta_{l}b_{lj_{1}}^{\dagger}b_{lj_{1}+s}^{\dagger}b_{lj_{2}%
+s}b_{lj_{2}}=\sum_{\substack{1\leq l\leq r\\1\leq j_{1},j_{2}\leq
s}}c_{lj_{1}}c_{lj_{2}}\beta_{l}b_{lj_{1}}^{\dagger}\left(  \delta_{j_{1}%
j_{2}}-b_{lj_{2}+s}b_{lj_{1}+s}^{\dagger}\right)  b_{lj_{2}}\nonumber\\
